From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rance9 <rance9@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:42:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Mapper 30: submapper 4 takes flash commands when flash is
 enabled

With the battery bit set, writes to $8000-$BFFF reach the flash command
handler on submapper 4 as on submappers 0 and 1; without it the window
stays unhandled.
---
 src/boards/unrom512.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/boards/unrom512.c b/src/boards/unrom512.c
index 56bd58e..69aa650 100644
--- a/src/boards/unrom512.c
+++ b/src/boards/unrom512.c
@@ -174,7 +174,7 @@ static void UNROM512LatchPower(void) {
 		SetWriteHandler(0x8000, 0xFFFF, UNROM512HLatchWrite);
 	else
 	{
-		if (submapper != 4) SetWriteHandler(0x8000, 0xBFFF, UNROM512LLatchWrite);
+		if (submapper != 4 || flash_save) SetWriteHandler(0x8000, 0xBFFF, UNROM512LLatchWrite);
 		SetWriteHandler(0xC000, 0xFFFF, UNROM512HLatchWrite);
 	}
 }
